        "created_at": "2018-08-08T17:58:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What are the best choices you can make when a \"Representative of Earth\"&nbsp; is called out?&nbsp; Obviously, you'd want to pick a card with a power that one of the other heroes might be able to use. The choice is obviously situational, but the ones I've been focusing on are:</p>\n<p>Top Choices:</p>\n<p>Captain Cosmic (Requital): Play top 3 cards of a hero's deck, no worry about a construct penalty</p>\n<p><span>Sky-Scraper (Base, Huge): 2 sonic damage to each non-hero (If hero damage due to boosting, then Base Tempest instead)</span></p>\n<p>Tier 2:</p>\n<p>Legacy (Base): +1 damge for a round</p>\n<p>Grandpa Legacy: Heal 1 hp + use a power of choice</p>\n<p><span>Team Leader Tachyon: Everybody gets a free card (sometimes super helpful, other times unimportant)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Are there other good options I've missed? I haven't gone through all of the Oblivaeon stuff yet, so I'm not sure if there are other useful choices in there.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:39.619Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
