        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-08T19:05:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I use F5 Bunker and F5 AZ frequently.&nbsp; Reveal the top card of each deck and pick one to play, or deal a little bit of self-damage to dig through your deck and pull out any Ongoing you want.&nbsp; Sometimes XPW AA--a bit of damage for another hero's power use and a play is quite nice.</p><p>A lot depends on whether you have heroes that can trigger another hero's power, though.&nbsp; If you have Grandpa Legacy, using him on Requital CC is pointless (he has no deck), but using him on F5 Bunker is even better.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:43.143Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
