        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-08T20:00:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Good suggestions, thanks!</p><p>I'm still fighting my way through the current Weekly One-Shot and \"Rep of Earth\" is a dangerous card in that game, so pulling a hero that can destroy env cards certainly makes sense.</p><p>I also hadn't thought of another hero using F5 AZ's power to pull their own ongoings, that's quite clever!</p><p>One of my favorite games with the Celestial Tribunal was when I had The Sentinels fairly well set up and had Requital CC as the Rep of Earth to let them get three extra card plays. They won that game pretty quickly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
